      * GOTO, CABxx and TAG (RV-14): skip, end of subroutine, loop back, leave
     H
     C                     Z-ADD0         CNT   50
      * 1. Skip forward: GOTO with an indicator over a group of lines
     C   01                GOTO SKIP1
     C           1         ADD  CNT       CNT   50
     C           2         ADD  CNT       CNT   50
     C           SKIP1     TAG
      * 2. CABxx forward
     C           CNT       CABGT99        SKIP2
     C           3         ADD  CNT       CNT   50
     C           SKIP2     TAG
      * 3. Loop back: CABLT to the TAG
     C           AGAIN     TAG
     C           1         ADD  CNT       CNT   50
     C           CNT       CABLT10        AGAIN
      * 4. Subroutine: jump to its last TAG
     C                     EXSR CHECK
     C                     SETON                         LR
     C           CHECK     BEGSR
     C   02                GOTO DONE
     C           5         ADD  CNT       CNT   50
     C           DONE      TAG
     C                     ENDSR
      * 5. Not converted: backward GOTO to a TAG that two jumps use
     C           TWICE     TAG
     C   03                GOTO TWICE
     C   04                GOTO TWICE
